<title>CHINA: China '96 grain output seen to exceed 480 mln T.</title>
<headline>China '96 grain output seen to exceed 480 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's grain output was forecast to exceed 480 million tonnes in 1996, the State Statistical Bureau said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>The figure would beat 1995's record output by about 15 million tonnes.</p>
<p>Agricultural officials have said a rise in the state purchasing price of cereals earlier this year had encouraged farmers to grow more grain.</p>
<p>China has set a target of 465 million tonnes for 1996.</p>
</text>
